---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; const order=Astro.url.searchParams.get('order')??'pedido-demo';
---
<BaseLayout title="Pago recibido — PULSO" description="Estado de tu inscripción." noindex><section class="payment-return"><div class="payment-mark">✓</div><span class="section-index">Pedido {order}</span><h1>Pago recibido.</h1><p>En la integración real, Galileo confirmará el webhook de Redsys antes de marcar la inscripción como pagada.</p><div><a class="button button--lime" href="/mis-carreras">Ver mis carreras <span>→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/carreras">Volver al calendario</a></div></section></BaseLayout><style>.payment-return{min-height:calc(100svh - var(--header));background:var(--ink);color:var(--white);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:clamp(2rem,8vw,8rem)}.payment-mark{width:5rem;height:5rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--lime);color:var(--ink);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:2rem}.payment-return .section-index{color:var(--lime)}.payment-return h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,10vw,10rem);line-height:.85;margin:1rem 0 2rem}.payment-return p{color:#aaa;max-width:39rem;line-height:1.6}.payment-return>div:last-child{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2rem;margin-top:2rem}</style>
